{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And they beat them.</b> Upon the children of Israel, and I have also explained the meaning of להוסיף." "Now yesterday was the day that Moses performed the signs before the people, and they did not engage in their labor; also today, when Moses and Aaron came to Pharaoh — and so it is written: \"And Pharaoh commanded on that day\" (above, verse 6)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "He says he already explained the word להוסיף ('to add') earlier; no earlier comment on this term has been identified in his commentary, so the reference is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:57.406963654Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}